                <pb facs="0732" n="644" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg644"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-13"><hi rendition="#italic">September 13,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee informs Mr. Barrett that Haass has been in Panama for some time, and
                    that it is expected that he will be at the Hotel Gran Central to-day.)</p>
            </div>
